            "excerpt": "theorem UpperTheory.Top.every_character_of_green_v_win (hG : GlobalTheory.GLq.Green) (hV : UpperTheory.Top.VWin)\n    (h : Nonempty (_root_.GlobalTheory.Fc.HypsAlt (fun 𝒞 => Closed 𝒞 fun Fm _ => LinkN Fm) _root_.GlobalTheory.Fc.DefiniteSideCondition)) : UpperTheory.EveryCharacter :=\n  UpperTheory.Top.imprimitive (_root_.UpperTheory.Top.zero_free_all_of_green_v_win hG hV h)"
