            "excerpt": "def ChebyshevInequalityAtWindowScale (la : ℝ) (Λ : Level) : Prop :=\n  ∃ eD eL ε₁ : ℝ, 0 < ε₁ ∧ ∀ eps : ℝ, 0 < eps → eps < ε₁ → ∃ Fm : Fam eps, EFamC Λ (core Fm) ∧\n    (core Fm).Windows la ∧ ChebyshevInequalityOnFamilyWindows @core @Tied Fm eD eL"
