            "excerpt": "theorem zeroFree_of_rpow_window (F : CharFamily) {θ δ C : ℝ} (hθ : 0 < θ) (hθ1 : θ < 1) (hδ : 0 < δ)\n    (h : ∀ Y₀ : ℝ, ∃ Y : ℝ, Y₀ ≤ Y ∧ ∀ y ∈ Set.Icc Y (Y ^ (1 + δ)), Gm F y ≤ C * y ^ θ) :\n    ZeroFree F θ :=\n  lemmaL F hθ hθ1 hδ (windowHyp_of_rpow F hδ h)"
