        "title": "Reflect an arbitrary character",
        "contract": "Claim.HalfPlane implies Claim.Strip.",
        "idea": "Reduce a left-hand zero to its primitive inducing character, reflect it, then use h. A right-hand zero directly contradicts h.",
        "assumptions": [
