        "id": "tlift-def",
        "component": "galois",
        "section": "arithmetic",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "Quantifiers of the theta lift",
        "contract": "For each admissible CM setup, n≥1 and X, there exists d₀; for each d≥d₀, permissible W, Hecke characters, weights and U, an IsLift witness U′ exists.",
        "idea": "The weight inequality is imposed after the choice of d. The lift has an explicit existential codomain.",
