        "section": "arithmetic",
        "kind": "reducer",
        "title": "Combine divisibility, slopes and windows",
        "contract": "The listed existence, local, rank, divisibility, global and slope controls produce FamilyClassConnected.",
        "idea": "Construct one family after taking a common epsilon threshold. Its loss exponents are the given eD and eL.",
        "assumptions": [
