        "id": "divin",
        "component": "family",
        "section": "arithmetic",
        "kind": "reducer",
        "title": "Control the local divisibility loss",
        "contract": "For ε>0, HypV, LinkN and SmallLevelRankEq imply DIVinN on the family.",
        "idea": "Bound the weighted cohomology sum, replace the rank and absorb log²x into x^ε.",
        "assumptions": [
          "HypV",
          "LinkN",
          "SmallLevelRankEq",
          "0<ε"
        ],
        "lean_head": "theorem divinN_of_hypV {eps : ℝ} (Fm : FamP eps) (heps : 0 < eps) (hV : HypV Fm.toFamCore) (hN : LinkN Fm) (hR : SmallLevelRankEq Fm) :\n    DIVinN Fm",
        "declaration": "UpperTheory.Top.divinN_of_hypV",
        "module": "Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.CharacterBoxes.DivinNOfHypV",
        "url": "https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/CharacterBoxes/DivinNOfHypV.lean#L117-L130",
        "excerpt": "theorem divinN_of_hypV {eps : ℝ} (Fm : FamP eps) (heps : 0 < eps) (hV : HypV Fm.toFamCore) (hN : LinkN Fm) (hR : SmallLevelRankEq Fm) :\n    DIVinN Fm := by\n  obtain ⟨x1, h1⟩ := hV\n  obtain ⟨C, x3, h3⟩ := hN\n  obtain ⟨x4, h4⟩ := hR\n  obtain ⟨x6, h6⟩ := log_sq_le_rpow heps\n  refine ⟨|C| + 1, max (max x1 (max x3 x4)) (max x6 (Fm.x1 + 1)), fun x hx i j hj => ?_⟩\n  simp only [ge_iff_le, max_le_iff] at hx\n  obtain ⟨⟨g1, g3, g4⟩, g6, g7⟩ := hx\n  obtain ⟨hf, hs, hle⟩ := vvRecord _ _ (h1 x g1 i)\n  have hb : 1 ≤ (Fm.L x i).sc.b := Real.one_le_exp (Real.rpow_nonneg (by linarith [(Fm.L x i).sc.one_lt_alt]) _)\n  refine divinN_at _ j C hj (h3 x g3 i hf j hj) hs (hle.trans (Real.sqrt_le_self_iff.2 (Or.inr hb))) (h4 x g4 i j hj) ?_\n  rw [Fm.L_x x i (by linarith), Fm.L_eps x i]\n  exact h6 x g6",
