        "lean_head": "theorem windowInequality_of_artinInputs\n    (h : ∀ {eps : ℝ} (Fm : Fam eps) (eD eL K cHH eK CL x : ℝ), Tied Fm eD eL K cHH eK CL x → FamCoreConstantBounds (core Fm) eD eL K cHH eK x)\n    (Λ : Level) : ChebyshevInequalityOnWindows @core @Tied Λ",
        "declaration": "UpperTheory.Comparison₂.windowInequality_of_artinInputs",
        "module": "Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.PrimitiveCosets.WindowInequalityOfArtinInputs",
        "url": "https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/PrimitiveCosets/WindowInequalityOfArtinInputs.lean#L17-L25",
        "excerpt": "theorem windowInequality_of_artinInputs\n    (h : ∀ {eps : ℝ} (Fm : Fam eps) (eD eL K cHH eK CL x : ℝ), Tied Fm eD eL K cHH eK CL x → FamCoreConstantBounds (core Fm) eD eL K cHH eK x)\n    (Λ : Level) : ChebyshevInequalityOnWindows @core @Tied Λ := by\n  rintro eD eL eps he Fm ⟨C, xE, hE⟩ ⟨K, cHH, eK, CL, x0, hT⟩\n  obtain ⟨x1, hx1⟩ := core_gm Λ eD eL K cHH eK C eps he\n  refine ⟨max x1 (max x0 xE), fun x hx hw => ?_⟩\n  have b := le_of_max_le_right hx\n  obtain ⟨i, hi⟩ := h Fm _ _ _ _ _ _ _ (hT x (le_of_max_le_left b) hw)\n  exact hx1 x (le_of_max_le_left hx) _ ((core Fm).D x i).host.toHostAx _ (hE x (le_of_max_le_right b) i) hi",
