      {
        "id": "form-b",
        "component": "criterion",
        "section": "windows",
        "kind": "reducer",
        "title": "The analytic criterion for a level",
        "contract": "For every level, every λ>1 and 0<θ<1, arbitrarily late windows bounded by x^θ imply no zero right of θ.",
        "idea": "Translate the level to a finite character family with positive weights. Apply the power-window theorem with δ=λ−1 and C=1.",
        "assumptions": [],
        "lean_head": "theorem UpperTheory.Comparison₂.formB :\n    ∀ Λ : Level, Λ.FormB",
        "declaration": "UpperTheory.Comparison₂.formB",
        "module": "Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.PrimitiveCosets.Imports",
        "url": "https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/PrimitiveCosets/Imports.lean#L8-L19",
        "excerpt": "theorem UpperTheory.Comparison₂.formB :\n    ∀ Λ : Level, Λ.FormB := by\n  intro Λ la hla θ hθ0 hθ1 hW\n  obtain ⟨F, hG, hZ⟩ := UpperTheory.Comparison₂.level_family Λ\n  rw [← hZ]\n  refine Deduction.zeroFree_of_rpow_window F (δ := la - 1) (C := 1) hθ0 hθ1 (by linarith) fun Y₀ => ?_\n  obtain ⟨Y, hY, hx⟩ := hW Y₀\n  refine ⟨Y, hY, fun y hy => ?_⟩\n  have h1 : (1 : ℝ) + (la - 1) = la := by ring\n  rw [h1] at hy\n  rw [hG, one_mul]\n  exact hx y hy.1 hy.2",
