        "url": "https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/DedekindLFunctions/LandauTheorems/lemmaL.lean#L13-L22",
        "excerpt": "theorem lemmaL (F : CharFamily) {θ δ : ℝ} (hθ : 0 < θ) (hθ1 : θ < 1) (hδ : 0 < δ) (h : WindowHyp F θ δ) :\n    ZeroFree F θ := by\n  intro i s hs hzero\n  obtain ⟨Φ, hP⟩ := poleData F\n  have hZ := landau_window hP hθ hθ1 hδ (windowHypU_of_windowHyp F hδ h)\n  by_cases h1 : 1 ≤ s.re\n  · exact charFamily_LFunction_ne_zero_of_one_le_re F i s h1 hzero\n  · have hmem : s ∈ zeroSet F := ⟨by linarith, i, Or.inl hzero⟩\n    have := hZ s hmem\n    linarith",
