        "module": "Development.AbelianVarietyTheory.Definitions.GlobalTwisting.PairRowIffQdRows",
        "url": "https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AbelianVarietyTheory/Definitions/GlobalTwisting/PairRowIffQdRows.lean#L28-L32",
        "excerpt": "def RankVal (s : Scale) (R : Ranks) : Prop :=\n  (s.x ^ (2 + 8 * s.eps) ≤ (R.n : ℝ) ∧ (R.n : ℝ) ≤ 2 * s.x ^ (2 + 8 * s.eps)) ∧\n  (Real.sqrt (s.x * s.delta1) ≤ (R.m : ℝ) ∧ (R.m : ℝ) ≤ 2 * Real.sqrt (s.x * s.delta1)) ∧\n  (s.x ^ (9 / 2 + 10 * s.eps) ≤ (R.k : ℝ) ∧ (R.k : ℝ) ≤ 2 * s.x ^ (9 / 2 + 10 * s.eps)) ∧\n  R.r + R.t = 8 * R.f * R.r + 4 + TOv s * nWv R s",
