        "kind": "lemma",
        "title": "The lattice slope inequality",
        "contract": "The sublattice bound SlopeLeMuMax implies SlopeInequality for injective norm-bounded lattice maps.",
        "idea": "A Gram determinant bounds the image covolume by C to the rank times the source covolume.",
        "assumptions": [
          "SlopeLeMuMax; in the result, discrete lattices, nonzero source, injectivity and norm bound C"
        ],
        "lean_head": "theorem slopeInequality_of (h : SlopeLeMuMax.{v}) : SlopeInequality.{u, v}",
        "declaration": "Formalism.F.slopeInequality_of",
        "module": "Formalism.LatticeSlopes.LatticeSlopesProofs.SlopeInequality",
        "url": "https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Formalism/LatticeSlopes/LatticeSlopesProofs/SlopeInequality.lean#L111-L125",
        "excerpt": "theorem slopeInequality_of (h : SlopeLeMuMax.{v}) : SlopeInequality.{u, v} := by\n  intro E F _ _ _ _ _ _ L M hL hM hne φ C hφ hC\n  classical\n  let g : L →ₗ[ℤ] F := M.subtype.comp φ\n  have ginj : Function.Injective g := M.injective_subtype.comp hφ\n  let N : Submodule ℤ F := LinearMap.range g\n  have hNM : N ≤ M := by\n    rintro _ ⟨x, rfl⟩\n    exact (φ x).2\n  haveI : DiscreteTopology L := hL\n  haveI : DiscreteTopology M := hM\n  haveI : DiscreteTopology N :=\n    DiscreteTopology.of_continuous_injective (continuous_inclusion hNM)\n      (Submodule.inclusion_injective hNM)\n  let e : L ≃ₗ[ℤ] N := LinearEquiv.ofInjective g ginj",
