        "module": "Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.LayeredIsomorphisms.ThmBabOfLemmaK",
        "url": "https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/LayeredIsomorphisms/ThmBabOfLemmaK.lean#L9-L12",
        "excerpt": "theorem thmBab_of_lemmaK (hP : GlobalTheory.Published.PoitouTateDuality) (hF : LocalFinitenessK) (hT : LocalTateDualityK)\n    (hFW : Published.FerreroWashington) (hK : ∃ CK : ℝ, LemmaK CK) : ∃ K : BConst, ∀ Ct : ℝ, 1 ≤ Ct → ThmBab K Ct :=\n  have hA : Two.TowerBound := fun l _ L _ _ R h => PropA.aBound_of_isTower hP hF hT l L R h\n  thmBab_of hK (Two.fixedIn hFW hA) (Two.twoIn hFW hA)",
