        "component": "cohomology",
        "section": "cohomology",
        "kind": "producer",
        "title": "Uniform ℓ-rank of class groups in the tower",
        "contract": "For each eligible abelian base K and prime ℓ there is an exponent r bounding the order of the quotient by ℓ-th powers by ℓʳ on every cyclotomic layer.",
        "idea": "Embed the abelian base into a cyclotomic field. Use the cyclotomic index estimate and descend across a uniformly bounded degree. The root-of-unity premise in the published interface is unused by this proof.",
        "assumptions": [],
        "lean_head": "theorem UpperTheory.V.FW.ferreroWashington : UpperTheory.V.Published.FerreroWashington",
        "declaration": "UpperTheory.V.FW.ferreroWashington",
        "module": "Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.GaloisLibrary.FerreroWashingtonIndex.FerreroWashington",
        "url": "https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/GaloisLibrary/FerreroWashingtonIndex/FerreroWashington.lean#L104-L119",
        "excerpt": "theorem UpperTheory.V.FW.ferreroWashington : UpperTheory.V.Published.FerreroWashington := by\n  unfold UpperTheory.V.Published.FerreroWashington\n  intro l _ K _ _ _ _\n  obtain ⟨f, D, hf, h1, hemb⟩ := embed l K\n  obtain ⟨B, n₀, hB⟩ := cyc l f hf h1\n  refine ⟨D * l ^ n₀ * B, ?_⟩\n  intro n K' _ _ _ _\n  obtain ⟨m, L, iF, iN, iA, iC, hm, hdeg⟩ := hemb n n₀ K'\n  obtain ⟨htc, hidx⟩ := hB m hm L\n  have hd := desc l K' L htc\n  have hl2 : 1 < l := (Fact.out : l.Prime).one_lt\n  have key : Nat.card (ClassGroup (𝓞 K') ⧸ (powMonoidHom l).range) ≤ D * l ^ n₀ * B := by\n    have e : Nat.card (ClassGroup (𝓞 K') ⧸ (powMonoidHom l).range) = (powR (Cl K') l).index := rfl\n    rw [e]\n    exact hd.trans (Nat.mul_le_mul hdeg hidx)\n  exact key.trans (Nat.lt_pow_self hl2).le",
