        "url": "https://github.com/Deicyde/riemann-hypothesis/blob/40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005/src/Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/HeightAndVanishing/JointWinOfCounts.lean#L30-L33",
        "excerpt": "theorem vwin_of_counts (hP : GlobalTheory.Published.PoitouTateDuality) (hF : LocalFinitenessK) (hT : LocalTateDualityK) {CK : ℝ}\n    (hK : LemmaK CK) {K : BConst} (hB : ThmBab K 401) (hc : ThmBcFree) (h1 : CountI) (h2 : CountII) (h3 : CountIII)\n    (h5 : CountV) (hZ : CountZ) : VWin :=\n  vwin_of_joint (jointWin_of_counts hP hF hT hK hB h1 h2 h3 h5 hZ) ((thmBc_iff (by norm_num)).2 hc)",
