        "contract": "The archive supplies its first-moment limit without an RH assumption.",
        "idea": "The public theorem calls the source-level proof psiZeroConst_main. This separate theorem helps explain the reverse implication for the singleton zeta family.",
        "assumptions": [],
        "lean_head": "theorem psi_zero_integral_constant : Formalism.HermitianLattices.GL2a2.PsiZeroConst",
