                "That the 'matching chord' is Frobenius characteristic polynomials equalling Satake parameters",
                "The theta-lift and weight-one inputs that the construction depends on"
              ],
              "where_metaphor_breaks": "A twin sounds like a copy that can be checked by ear. The real correspondence can only be checked at infinitely many primes through polynomials, and here it is supplied by named theorems, not shown directly."
            }
