              "where_metaphor_breaks": "The reference to a Kudla–Rallis-style stable range is an interpretive gloss, not part of the formal core. The capsule pins only the Lean statements, and whether the encoded TLiftK and PropsB coincide with the classical theorems is a question for human review."
            }
          },
