            "explanation": "published_results_eigen supplies UnitaryGroupThirdPlaceHypotheses (Clozel cohomological, Green cuspidality, Hecke l-adic character, degree-one Chebotarev, Galois representations of polarized cuspidals, base change for the definite unitary group). published_results_first supplies ThetaLocalInputs (Green series, Linnik, CM j, cuspidal mirabolic, Weyl branching, Bernstein unitary-product irreducibility, Zelevinsky polynomial ring, Bernstein–Zelevinsky finiteness). The covolume bound rests on PublishedHodgeBundleTheorems (toroidal compactification, volumes, nef, arithmetic computation, abelian de Rham) plus Hilbert–Samuel–Moriwaki, Fargues and Zarhin, while recTExists extends a parameter from the cuspidal representations (exists_isLExt) and establishes dimension and twist compatibility.",
