                "The measurability and integrability lemmas (F_measurable, core_integrable)",
                "The full structure of the Mellin ramp passed through the interface to residues"
              ],
              "where_metaphor_breaks": "The first-moment computation concerns only the trivial character modulo 1, the singleton zeta family. It does not bound G_P on windows; that bound comes from the comparison layer."
            }
          },
