                "The bodies of prim_zero and of Mathlib's completedLFunction_one_sub / riemannZeta_one_sub",
                "The alternate route UpperTheory.riemannHypothesis_of_everyCharacter, which derives RH from the same hypothesis"
              ],
              "where_metaphor_breaks": "Input→output framing hides that the input is a proposition quantified over infinitely many moduli, characters and complex points, not a runtime value that could be sampled or tested."
            }
