                "L0": "Even a very long twist fits under one ceiling, and the same ceiling works whichever few helper primes you pick.",
                "L1": "The bound is uniform. Tower growth is fixed, rank controls the operator norm, and the window constants do not depend on the chosen finite set of coefficient primes. The counting splits into inside and outside parts.",
                "L2": "Tower chain: produce → fixed growth → use → window from lemma K → bound from rank → operator bound → window constants. Counting chain: common integer, window, joint, pointwise, inside/outside. Output: VWinAt (if-05).",
